<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Stratus Computer raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Stratus Computer raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley raised its recommendation on Stratus Computer Inc to outperform from neutral, according to a market source.</p>
<p>-- The $2.70 per share 1997 earnings estimate likely will be raised to around $3.00 per share, in light of the company's first quarter earnings report early Tuesday of $0.62 per share versus $0.45 one year ago, the source said.</p>
<p>-- Shares finished Monday New York Stock Exchange trade at 31-3/8.</p>
</text>
